#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:106
msgid "1) Certificates must be prepared for all environments (self-signed allowed) following the requirements in Certificate Governance - Authentication: TNPTLS - Upload: TNPUP - SCA(s): TNPSCA"
msgstr "1) 必须按照证书治理中的要求为所有环境准备证书（允许自签名）——身份认证：TNPTLS - 上传：TNPUP - SCA：TNPSCA"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:289
msgid "1) check the connectivity with the following command:   input:"
msgstr "1) 使用以下命令检查连通性：   输入："

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:117
msgid "2) Prepare public keys in PEM format in your private GitHub repository (see [11]) dedicated to the used environment keys."
msgstr "2) 在专用于所用环境密钥的私有 GitHub 仓库（参见 [11]）中准备 PEM 格式的公钥。"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:324
msgid "2) Test the other Trustlist Routes in the same style (e. g. with DSC/SCA/Upload/Authentication…)"
msgstr "2) 以同样方式测试其他信任列表路由（例如 DSC/SCA/Upload/Authentication…）"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:159
msgid "3-digit ISO Participant code"
msgstr "3 位 ISO 参与方代码"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:194
