msgid "Onboard a GDHCN Participant to a Trust Domain, in three phases: apply and verify, set up and go live."
msgstr "将 GDHCN 参与方接入某一信任域，分三个阶段：申请与验证、设置、上线。"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:48
msgid "Onboard a Participant (top level)"
msgstr "参与方入网（顶层）"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:9
msgid "Onboarding runs in three phases. In phase 1 the Participant applies and has its Letter of Application verified. In phase 2 the gateway operator registers the Participant's keys, once for each environment. In phase 3 the Participant connects to the gateway and passes the tests, first in UAT and then in PROD. After onboarding, a Participant may join a further Trust Domain, change its keys or its representatives, or end its participation, and an Eligible GDHCN Participant may propose a new Trust Domain."
msgstr "入网分三个阶段进行。在阶段 1，参与方提出申请，并使其申请函得到验证。在阶段 2，网关运营方按每个环境各注册一次参与方的密钥。在阶段 3，参与方连接网关并通过测试，先在 UAT，再在 PROD。入网之后，参与方可以加入另一个信任域、变更其密钥或代表，或终止其参与；合格 GDHCN 参与方可以提议新的信任域。"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:364
msgid "openssl base64 -in signed.der -out cms.b64 -e -A"
msgstr "openssl base64 -in signed.der -out cms.b64 -e -A"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:362
